(7123972, 1088741, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The simplicity of this work is so much more appealing them the exacting detail of features or flight.  Great editing.</td>', 'Very nice.  The simplicity of this work is so much more appealing them the exacting detail of features or flight.  Great editing.', '2013-10-31 21:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
